From: PupJune2 <PupJune2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000
Subject: CromIKO for Windows

Make the Windows build of Cromite CromIKO, next to the CromIKO name of
CromIKO-App-Name.patch:

- The icons of the app, of incognito windows, of web pages and PDF files
  and of the Start menu tiles, and the small logos and the logo with the
  name in the browser: the white mascot on the charcoal tile, like the
  Android app icon (incognito on a dark periwinkle tile). Drawn from the
  logo by tools/cromiko/gen_windows_icons.py.
- Its own profile folder (%LOCALAPPDATA%\CromIKO), names in Windows
  (default browser, taskbar, file types, cromiko:// links), notification
  id, startup lock and window class, so that it runs next to Cromite and
  Chromium instead of taking over their windows and settings.
- The periwinkle of the logo is the color of the browser until the user
  picks another one in Customize Chrome.

